    "387": {
      "date": "2026-11-12",
      "edition": "Thursday 12 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Dupont moves to fly-half as France hunt Springboks without Jalibert and Ntamack",
          "body": "Antoine Dupont starts at fly-half against South Africa on Friday, with Maxime Lucu at scrum-half, after Matthieu Jalibert, Romain Ntamack, Thomas Ramos and Antoine Hastoy were all absent. Dupont's fly-half experience is limited to a handful of games for Toulouse. South Africa coach Rassie Erasmus says the captain is hard to read: \"I don't even know if Dupont's team-mates know exactly what he's going to do next, so he's just really playing on instinct, which is tough to handle.\""
        },
        {
