          "heading": "Riccardo Casarin and Antony Italo Miranda join Italy's camp as invited players",
          "body": "Italy head coach Gonzalo Quesada has added two invitees to the squad training camp in Turin ahead of Saturday's test against Argentina. Riccardo Casarin, a centre at Valorugby, captained Italy U20 in the most recent Six Nations and the Junior Rugby World Cup, and has made an URC debut for Zebre Parma. Antony Italo Miranda, a Mogliano back-rower who was also part of the U20 group last season, joins him, and both are already available to the coaching staff."
