          "kicker": "Opposition scouting",
          "heading": "Wallabies wary of Scotland's Sione Tuipulotu as Test weekend approaches",
          "body": "Australia's caution ahead of the Round five Test is aimed squarely at one Scotland player. Wallabies captain Harry Wilson, speaking after the 45-22 defeat at Twickenham, said: \"Scotland are a really good team and we've got to be ready for it.\" Planet Rugby's opinion column argued Scotland will be a fairer fight for Australia than England was. Scotland, meanwhile, come into the match off a 21-43 loss to New Zealand in Round four."
