          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Steve Tandy weighs Adam Beard recall as Josh Adams may rest",
          "body": "Wales head coach Steve Tandy is weighing a pack reshuffle for Saturday's Nations Championship Test against New Zealand. Second-row Adam Beard, who lost his starting place to Ben Carter before the Six Nations, is set to drop to the bench after the Welsh lineout struggled in the 28-21 win over Japan. Josh Adams, who crossed twice against Japan, could be rested, though it is unclear whether that happens this week. Leicester wing Gabriel Hamer-Webb, who has one cap, is touted as the likeliest replacement."
