          "kicker": "Fullback crisis",
          "heading": "Tobías Wade called up after Juan Cruz Mallía's knee sprain in Dublin",
          "body": "Argentina head coach Felipe Contepomi has added Tobías Wade to the squad after Juan Cruz Mallía sprained a knee against Ireland. The depth behind him is thin: Santiago Carreras is out for the year and Benjamín Elizalde is also injured. Wade, a Zebre Parma fullback who plays his rugby in Italy, is uncapped and featured for the Argentina XV against England A last Friday. He is chasing a first cap, while Mateo Soler is after his second."
        },
